#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.1 Defining the transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian {#21-defining-the-transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "2.1 횡방향 자기장 이징 해밀토니안 정의하기 {#21-defining-the-transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We here consider the 1-D transverse-field Ising model.\n"
msgstr "여기서는 1차원 횡방향 자기장 이징 모델을 다룹니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we will create a function that takes in the system parameters $N$, $J$, $h$ and $\\alpha$, and returns our Hamiltonian as a `SparsePauliOp`. A [SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp) is a sparse representation of an operator in terms of weighted [Pauli](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli) terms.\n"
msgstr "먼저, 시스템 파라미터 $N$, $J$, $h$, $\\alpha$를 입력받아 해밀토니안을 `SparsePauliOp`으로 반환하는 함수를 만들겠습니다. [SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp)은 가중치가 부여된 [Pauli](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli) 항들로 연산자를 희소하게 표현한 것입니다.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "해밀토니안 정의하기 {#define-the-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The system that we now consider has a size of $N=6$, $J=0.2$, $h=1.2$ and $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{8.0}$ as an example.\n"
msgstr "예시로, 크기 $N=6$, $J=0.2$, $h=1.2$, $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{8.0}$인 시스템을 고려합니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.2 Set the parameters of the time-evolution simulation {#22-set-the-parameters-of-the-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr "2.2 시간 진화 시뮬레이션 파라미터 설정하기 {#22-set-the-parameters-of-the-time-evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we will consider three different Trotterization techniques:\n"
"* Lie–Trotter (first order)\n"
"* second-order Suzuki–Trotter\n"
"* fourth-order Suzuki–Trotter\n"
msgstr ""
"여기서는 세 가지 Trotterization 기법을 고려합니다.\n"
"* Lie–Trotter (1차)\n"
"* 2차 Suzuki–Trotter\n"
"* 4차 Suzuki–Trotter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The latter two will be used in the exercise, and in the appendix.\n"
msgstr "뒤의 두 가지는 연습 문제와 부록에서 사용됩니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.3 Prepare the quantum circuit 1 (Initial state) {#23-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-1-initial-state}"
msgstr "2.3 양자 Circuit 준비 1 (초기 상태) {#23-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-1-initial-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an initial state. Here we will start with a spin configuration of $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$\n"
".\n"
msgstr "초기 상태를 생성합니다. 여기서는 스핀 배열 $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$으로 시작합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/b338806d-67bf-47ae-9d03-944bde3e2c99-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/b338806d-67bf-47ae-9d03-944bde3e2c99-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.4 Prepare the quantum circuit 2 (Single circuit for time evolution) {#24-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"
msgstr "2.4 양자 Circuit 준비 2 (단일 시간 진화 Circuit) {#24-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We here construct a circuit for a single time step using Lie–Trotter.\n"
msgstr "여기서는 Lie–Trotter를 사용하여 단일 시간 스텝에 대한 Circuit을 구성합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Lie product formula (first-order) is implemented in the [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) class. A first-order formula consists of the approximation stated in the introduction, where the matrix exponential of a sum is approximated by a product of matrix exponentials:\n"
msgstr "Lie 곱 공식(1차)은 [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) 클래스에 구현되어 있습니다. 1차 공식은 서론에서 언급한 근사, 즉 합의 행렬 지수를 행렬 지수들의 곱으로 근사하는 것으로 구성됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As previously mentioned, very deep circuits lead to the accumulation of errors, and cause problems for modern quantum computers. Because two-qubit gates have higher error rates than single-qubit gates, a quantity of particular interest is the two-qubit circuit depth. What really matters is the two-qubit circuit depth after transpilation (since that is the circuit the quantum computer actually executes). But let us get in the habit of counting the operations for this circuit, even now using the simulator.\n"
msgstr "앞서 언급했듯이, Circuit이 매우 깊어지면 오류가 누적되어 현대 양자 컴퓨터에서 문제를 일으킵니다. 2-Qubit Gate는 단일 qubit Gate보다 오류율이 높기 때문에, 특히 중요한 지표는 2-Qubit Circuit 깊이입니다. 실질적으로 중요한 것은 트랜스파일 후의 2-Qubit Circuit 깊이입니다(그 Circuit이 실제로 양자 컴퓨터에서 실행되는 것이기 때문입니다). 하지만 지금은 시뮬레이터를 사용하더라도, 이 Circuit의 연산 수를 세는 습관을 들이도록 합시다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/252c2734-653d-4c8e-af6b-d3173845de88-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/252c2734-653d-4c8e-af6b-d3173845de88-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.5 Set the operators to measure {#25-set-the-operators-to-measure}"
msgstr "2.5 측정할 연산자 설정하기 {#25-set-the-operators-to-measure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us define a *magnetization operator* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i \\rangle / N$, and a *mean spin correlation operator* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle/ (N - 1)$.\n"
msgstr "*자기화 연산자* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i \\rangle / N$와 *평균 스핀 상관 연산자* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle/ (N - 1)$를 정의합니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.6 Perform time-evolution simulation {#26-perform-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr "2.6 시간 진화 시뮬레이션 수행하기 {#26-perform-time-evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will monitor the energy (expectation value of the Hamiltonian), magnetization (expectation value of the magnetization operator), and mean spin correlation (expectation value of the mean spin correlation operator). Qiskit's `StatevectorEstimator` (EstimatorV2) primitive estimates expectation values of observables, $\\langle\\psi\\vert\\hat{O}\\vert\\psi\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "에너지(해밀토니안의 기댓값), 자기화(자기화 연산자의 기댓값), 평균 스핀 상관(평균 스핀 상관 연산자의 기댓값)을 모니터링합니다. Qiskit의 `StatevectorEstimator`(EstimatorV2) 프리미티브는 관측량의 기댓값 $\\langle\\psi\\vert\\hat{O}\\vert\\psi\\rangle$을 추정합니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.7 Plot the time evolution of the observables {#27-plot-the-time-evolution-of-the-observables}"
msgstr "2.7 관측량의 시간 진화 플롯하기 {#27-plot-the-time-evolution-of-the-observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We plot the expectation values we measured against time.\n"
msgstr "측정한 기댓값을 시간에 대해 플롯합니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/9c0f4b39-801a-448c-9dce-8a6d7c83fe76-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/9c0f4b39-801a-448c-9dce-8a6d7c83fe76-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Exercise 1. Perform simulation using second-order Suzuki–Trotter {#3-exercise-1-perform-simulation-using-second-order-suzukitrotter}"
msgstr "3. 연습 1. 2차 Suzuki–Trotter를 사용한 시뮬레이션 수행 {#3-exercise-1-perform-simulation-using-second-order-suzukitrotter}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now let's try performing simulation with second-order Suzuki–Trotter following the example of Lie–Trotter shown above.\n"
msgstr "위에서 보여준 Lie–Trotter 예시를 참고하여, 2차 Suzuki–Trotter로 시뮬레이션을 수행해 보겠습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second-order Suzuki-Trotter can be used in Qiskit by means of the [SuzukiTrotter class](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.SuzukiTrotter). Using this formula, a second order decomposition is:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit에서 2차 Suzuki-Trotter는 [SuzukiTrotter 클래스](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.SuzukiTrotter)를 통해 사용할 수 있습니다. 이 공식을 사용하면 2차 분해는 다음과 같습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1/2}e^{H_2}e^{H_1/2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1/2}e^{H_2}e^{H_1/2}\n"
"$$\n"

